IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Business Names Registration Act 2014 (2020 Revised Edition), Singapore Statutes
-- Online, current version as at 30 Sep 2026.
-- Source: source/BNRA2014.txt (extracted from source/BNRA2014.pdf).
--
-- The shared nouns, and nothing else: DECLARE only, no rules, no #EVAL.
-- Every other module imports this one.
--
-- Membership test: could a witness of ordinary competence testify to this fact, or
-- does answering it require reading the Act?  Only the first kind is a field here.
-- "The person has a place of business in Singapore" is a fact; "the person is treated
-- as carrying on business in Singapore" is a rule (bnra-part1.l4).
--
-- Answers that belong to other Acts (whether a body is a "company" within the
-- Companies Act 1967, whether a society is registered under the Societies Act 1966,
-- what section 366 of the Companies Act calls an authorised representative of a
-- foreign company) are fields here, not rules.

§ `Part 1 -- Preliminary: the nouns of sections 2 to 4`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 2(1) 'business'"
DECLARE `Business Facts` HAS
    `the activity is a form of trade, commerce or profession` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the activity is any other activity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the activity is carried on for the purposes of gain` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the activity is an office, employment or occupation` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 2(1) 'individual'"
DECLARE `Individual Facts` HAS
    `the person is a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is an administrator, an executor, a liquidator, a trustee, a nominee or a guardian of an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is a donee or deputy appointed under the Mental Capacity Act 2008 in respect of an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has direct control or management of the business carried on by the individual` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 2(1) 'corporation'"
DECLARE `Corporation Facts` HAS
    `the body is a body corporate formed, incorporated or existing in Singapore or outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the body is a company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the body is a limited liability partnership registered under the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the body is a foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 2(1) 'firm'"
DECLARE `Firm Facts` HAS
    `the body is unincorporated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the members have entered into partnership with one another with a view to carrying on business for profit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of members who are individuals` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of members who are corporations` IS A NUMBER

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 2(1) 'contact address'"
DECLARE `Contact Address Facts` HAS
    `the address is a physical address at which the individual can be physically found or contacted by post` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the address is a post office box number` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the address is located in the same jurisdiction as the individual's residential address` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 2(1) 'full name'"
DECLARE `Full Name Facts` HAS
    `the individual is registered under the National Registration Act 1965` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name as it appears in the latest identity card issued to the individual` IS A STRING
    `the name as it appears in the latest passport issued to the individual or such other similar evidence of identification as is available` IS A STRING

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 2(2) and (3)"
DECLARE `Business Presence Facts` HAS
    `the person has a place of business in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person otherwise carries on business in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is a foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it is or becomes a party to an action, suit or proceeding, or effects a settlement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it holds meetings of its directors or shareholders or carries on other activities concerning its internal affairs` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it maintains a bank account` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it effects a sale through an independent contractor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it solicits or procures an order that becomes a binding contract only if accepted outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it creates evidence of a debt or creates a charge on property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it secures or collects its debts or enforces its rights in regard to securities for them` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it conducts an isolated transaction completed within 31 days that is not one of a number of similar transactions repeated from time to time` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it invests any of its funds or holds any property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it establishes a share transfer or share registration office` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it effects a transaction through its related corporation licensed or approved by the Monetary Authority of Singapore under an arrangement that Authority approved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in Singapore it carries on another activity that has been prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it does something else in Singapore that is a reason for treating it as carrying on business` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 4(1)(a) to (q), (2), (3), (5)"
DECLARE `Exemption Facts` HAS
    `an individual proprietor carrying on business under only the individual proprietor's full name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a firm of 2 or more individuals carrying on business under only the full names of all the individuals` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an individual or a firm of 2 or more individuals carrying on business consisting solely of the exercise of a profession that under a written law can be exercised only by those who possess certain qualifications and whose names are registered or otherwise recorded as that law prescribes` IS A BOOLEAN
    `regulations prescribe that the exemption for such a profession does not apply to the individual or firm` IS A BOOLEAN
    `another person carries on business for the person wholly or mainly as nominee or trustee and has provided the particulars required under section 7(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a statutory authority or other body established by or under a public Act for a public purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an institution, authority, person or fund specified in the First Schedule to the Income Tax Act 1947` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a society registered under the Societies Act 1966` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a society registered under the Co-operative Societies Act 1979` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a mutual benefit organisation registered under the Mutual Benefit Organisations Act 1960` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a trade union registered under the Trade Unions Act 1940` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a platform work association registered under the Platform Workers Act 2024` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Public Trustee or the Official Assignee of the property of a bankrupt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a foreign company registered under the Companies Act 1967 that carries on business under its registered name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a company carrying on business under its corporate name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a limited liability partnership registered under the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005 carrying on business under its registered name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` IS A BOOLEAN
    `section 42(3) of the Limited Partnerships Act 2008 removes the exemption for the limited partnership` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a person or class of persons for the time being exempted by the Minister under regulations made under section 43` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an individual proprietor who carried on a business specified in the First Schedule to the Business Registration Act immediately before 3 January 2016, is alive and continues to carry on the same business` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Part 2 -- Registration: the nouns of sections 5 to 11`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 5"
DECLARE `Registration Requirement Facts` HAS
    `the person carries on business in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person's business name is registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of business names the person intends to carry on business under` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of separate registrations` IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `Kind of Registrant` IS ONE OF
    `an individual proprietor`
    `a company that is a sole proprietor`
    `a limited liability partnership that is a sole proprietor`
    `a foreign company that is a sole proprietor`
    `a firm`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 6(1)(b)(iv), (vi) and (vii)"
DECLARE `Personal Particulars` HAS
    `the full name is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the identification is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the nationality is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the residential address is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contact address is stated` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 6(1)"
DECLARE `Application Facts` HAS
    `kind of registrant` IS A `Kind of Registrant`
    `the application is lodged with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application is lodged by an appropriate person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the business name is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the general nature of the business is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the principal place of business is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date or proposed date of commencement of business is stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the particulars of the individual proprietor` IS A `Personal Particulars`
    `the corporate name, registration number and registered office of the sole proprietor are stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the particulars of every partner who is an individual` IS A LIST OF `Personal Particulars`
    `the corporate name, registration number and registered office of every partner that is a corporation are stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the particulars of every authorised representative, if any` IS A LIST OF `Personal Particulars`
    `the other information that is prescribed is given` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Lodger Role` IS ONE OF
    `the individual proprietor`
    `a director or a secretary of the company`
    `a manager of the limited liability partnership`
    `an authorised representative of the foreign company, as section 366 of the Companies Act 1967 defines it`
    `a partner of the firm who is an individual`
    `a director or a secretary of a company that is a partner of the firm`
    `a manager of a limited liability partnership that is a partner of the firm`
    `an authorised representative of a foreign company that is a partner of the firm`
    `a registered corporate service provider authorised by and acting for the person`
    `someone else`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 7"
DECLARE `Nominee Facts` HAS
    `the person carries on business wholly or mainly as nominee or trustee of or for another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has provided the particulars section 6 requires` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has provided the further particulars that are prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the other person is a foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Registration Outcome` IS ONE OF
    `the Registrar must register the applicant and the business name and issue a notice of registration`
    `the Registrar must refuse to register`
    `the Registrar is not required to register`
    `there is no application to decide`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, ss 8(1), (5), 9, 13(1), 17(1) to (3)"
DECLARE `Registration Decision Facts` HAS
    `an application for registration under section 6 has been received` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar is satisfied with the particulars and other information provided` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar is satisfied that the business is likely to be used for an unlawful purpose or for purposes prejudicial to public peace, welfare or good order in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar is satisfied that it would be contrary to the national security or interest for the person to be registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is a foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the foreign company is registered under Division 2 of Part 11 of the Companies Act 1967` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the business name is one the Registrar must refuse under section 17` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Minister has consented to registration under the business name` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 8(2)"
DECLARE `Certificate Facts` HAS
    `the person is registered under section 8(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has lodged an application for a certificate of confirmation of registration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the prescribed fee has been paid` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 8(3) to (5)"
DECLARE `Renewal Facts` HAS
    `the person has lodged an application for renewal` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the prescribed fee has been paid` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar required additional particulars or information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the additional particulars or information were provided` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar is satisfied with the particulars and other information provided` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, ss 8(7), 12(4), 16(5), 17(9)"
DECLARE `Appeal Facts` HAS
    `the person is aggrieved by the decision` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the person was notified or informed of the decision` IS A DATE
    `the date of the appeal` IS A DATE
    `the date to which the Minister has allowed a further period, if any` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the decision is one to which the provision excludes an appeal because it rests on the Minister's certificate` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, ss 9, 12(1)(a), 13(1), 16(3)"
DECLARE `Public Interest Facts` HAS
    `the Registrar is satisfied that the business is likely to be used, or is used or intended to be used, for an unlawful purpose or for purposes prejudicial to public peace, welfare or good order in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar is satisfied that it would be contrary to the national security or interest` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Minister for internal security has issued a certificate stating that he or she is satisfied of that` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 11(14)"
DECLARE `Residence Facts` HAS
    `the person is a corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the corporation is incorporated or formed outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the individual's residential address is outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 11(1)"
DECLARE `Representative Requirement Facts` HAS
    `kind of registrant` IS A `Kind of Registrant`
    `the individual proprietor, the partners of the firm or the officers of the foreign company, as the case may be` IS A LIST OF `Residence Facts`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 11(2) and (16)"
DECLARE `Representative Qualification Facts` HAS
    `the person is a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person's age in years` IS A NUMBER
    `the person is otherwise of full legal capacity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is ordinarily resident in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 11(3), (4) and (11)"
DECLARE `Appointment Trigger` IS ONE OF
    `residing outside Singapore at the time of registration` HAS
        `the date of registration` IS A DATE
        `the date the business commences in Singapore` IS A DATE
    `ceasing to reside in Singapore after registration` HAS
        `the date the individual proprietor ceased to reside in Singapore, or the last partner or officer resident in Singapore ceased to reside there` IS A DATE
    `the sole authorised representative ceasing` HAS
        `the date the sole authorised representative ceased to be, or ceased to be qualified to be, the authorised representative` IS A DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 11(5) and (6)"
DECLARE `Representative Liability Facts` HAS
    `the date of the authorised representative's appointment` IS A DATE
    `the date the obligation attached to the registrant` IS A DATE
    `the obligation has been defaulted on` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 11(12)"
DECLARE `Representative Offence Facts` HAS
    `the registrant fails to comply with the requirement to appoint an authorised representative under section 11(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the registrant fails to lodge the notice under section 11(7)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the registrant fails to lodge the notice under section 11(9)` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Part 2 -- Registration: the nouns of sections 12 to 24`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 12(1)(b), (c), (2)"
DECLARE `Cancellation Grounds Facts` HAS
    `public interest facts` IS A `Public Interest Facts`
    `in connection with the person's business, the person carrying on the business, or another person appointed to manage it solely or substantially on that person's behalf, has been convicted of an offence under the Charities Act 1994` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person required to appoint an authorised representative failed to appoint one within the period required under section 11(3) or (4)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person failed to appoint a new authorised representative within 30 days after the sole authorised representative ceased to be, or ceased to be qualified to be, the authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Central Provident Fund Board has notified the Registrar that the person is a member of the Central Provident Fund and has failed to comply with section 9A of the Central Provident Fund Act 1953` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 12(3)"
DECLARE `Cancellation Procedure Facts` HAS
    `the Registrar gave the person notice in writing of the intention to cancel` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of days the notice specified for written representations` IS A NUMBER
    `the Registrar considered the written representations, if any, received within the time specified` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 14"
DECLARE `Expiry Facts` HAS
    `the registration has expired` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar gave written notice that the registration may be cancelled unless renewed within the period stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date of the notice` IS A DATE
    `the last day of the period stated in the notice` IS A DATE
    `the registration was renewed within the period stated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the registration has been cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 15"
DECLARE `Use of Name Facts` HAS
    `the person is required to be registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is registered under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person carries on business under a business name other than the registered business name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is not required to be registered in respect of that business name under section 4` IS A BOOLEAN
    `use of the registered business name is otherwise prohibited under a written law or other law` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Reservation Decision` IS ONE OF
    `approved` HAS
        `the date the Registrar notifies the applicant of the approval` IS A DATE
        `the number of further periods of 60 days the Registrar has extended the reservation by` IS A NUMBER
    `refused` HAS
        `the date the Registrar notifies the applicant of the refusal` IS A DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 16(1) to (4)"
DECLARE `Reservation Facts` HAS
    `the application is lodged with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the application is made in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name is one in respect of which the person may be registered having regard to section 17(1), (2) and (3)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `public interest facts` IS A `Public Interest Facts`
    `the application is by or on behalf of a foreign company not registered under Division 2 of Part 11 of the Companies Act 1967` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the Registrar receives the application` IS A DATE
    `decision` IS A `Reservation Decision`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 17(1)"
DECLARE `Name Restriction Facts` HAS
    `the name is undesirable in the Registrar's opinion` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name is identical to any other registered business name, or to the name of a corporation or limited partnership` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name is identical to a name reserved under section 16 of this Act or under a listed provision of the Companies Act 1967, the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005 or the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name is of a kind the Minister has directed the Registrar, by notification in the Gazette, not to accept for registration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Minister has consented` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 17(2)"
DECLARE `Earlier Use of Name` IS ONE OF
    `the business name of a person whose registration was cancelled under this Act or has ceased under section 22` HAS
        `the date of the cancellation or cessation` IS A DATE
    `the name of a company dissolved following its winding up under Part 8 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` HAS
        `the date of the dissolution of the company after winding up` IS A DATE
    `the name of a company dissolved following its name being struck off under section 344 or 344A of the Companies Act 1967` HAS
        `the date of the dissolution of the company after strike-off` IS A DATE
    `the name of a foreign company of whose dissolution notice has been given under section 377(2) of the Companies Act 1967` HAS
        `the date of the dissolution of the foreign company` IS A DATE
    `the name of a limited liability partnership dissolved following its winding up` HAS
        `the date of the dissolution of the limited liability partnership after winding up` IS A DATE
    `the name of a limited liability partnership dissolved following its name being struck off under section 63 of the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005` HAS
        `the date of the dissolution of the limited liability partnership after strike-off` IS A DATE
    `the name of a limited partnership whose registration was cancelled under section 14(1) or 19(4) of the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` HAS
        `the date of the cancellation of the limited partnership` IS A DATE
    `the name of a limited partnership dissolved under section 19(2) of the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` HAS
        `the date of the dissolution of the limited partnership` IS A DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 17(3)"
DECLARE `Permitted Earlier Use` IS ONE OF
    `the name of a foreign company that lodged notice under section 377(1) of the Companies Act 1967 that it ceased to have a place of business or to carry on business in Singapore` HAS
        `the date of the foreign company's cessation` IS A DATE
    `the name of a foreign company struck off under section 377(8), (9) or (10) of the Companies Act 1967` HAS
        `the date the name was struck off` IS A DATE
    `the name of a limited partnership that lodged notice under section 19(1) of the Limited Partnerships Act 2008 that it ceased to carry on business in Singapore` HAS
        `the date of the limited partnership's cessation` IS A DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 17(4)"
DECLARE `Direction Grounds Facts` HAS
    `the name is not permitted to be registered under section 17(1)(a), (b) or (d)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name is not permitted under section 17(2) until the relevant period has expired` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name is permitted under section 17(3) only after the relevant period has expired` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the name so nearly resembles the name of a corporation or limited partnership, or a registered business name, as to be likely to be mistaken for it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the use of the name has been restrained by an injunction granted under the Trade Marks Act 1998` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 17(4), (6), (7), (8)"
DECLARE `Direction Facts` HAS
    `the date of the Registrar's direction` IS A DATE
    `the date to which the Registrar has allowed a longer period, if any` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the date the person changes the registered business name, if it has been changed` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the date the person was registered in respect of the name, or the change of name was approved` IS A DATE
    `the date the Registrar receives an application under section 17(6)` IS A DATE
    `the ground of the application is that the name so nearly resembles another name as to be likely to be mistaken for it` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 18"
DECLARE `Name Change Facts` HAS
    `the application to change the registered business name is lodged with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar approves the application` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the new name is one the Registrar must refuse under section 17` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Minister has consented` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Kind of Address Holder` IS ONE OF
    `a registered individual proprietor`
    `a partner of a registered firm who is an individual`
    `an authorised representative`
    `someone else`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 19"
DECLARE `Address Change Facts` HAS
    `kind of holder` IS A `Kind of Address Holder`
    `the date of the change of residential address` IS A DATE
    `the individual has made a report of the change under section 10 of the National Registration Act 1965` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Kind of Change` IS ONE OF
    `a change of the residential address of a registered individual proprietor, of a partner of a registered firm who is an individual, or of an authorised representative`
    `a change of a registered business name`
    `a change in any other registered particular`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 20(1) and (2)"
DECLARE `Particulars Change Facts` HAS
    `kind of change` IS A `Kind of Change`
    `the date of the change` IS A DATE
    `the last day the Registrar has allowed, on application, for lodging the notice` IS A MAYBE DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 20(3) and (4)"
DECLARE `Partner Cessation Facts` HAS
    `the date the person ceased to be a partner of the registered firm` IS A DATE
    `the person required to lodge the notice cannot be located or found` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar has allowed the other persons required to lodge the notice to do so` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Kind of Notice` IS ONE OF
    `a notice of a change in particulars under section 20(1)`
    `a notice of a partner's cessation under section 20(3)`
    `a notice of cessation of business under section 22(1)`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 21"
DECLARE `Deceased Registrant Facts` HAS
    `the deceased was a registered individual proprietor or a partner of a registered firm who is an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is the personal representative of the deceased` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person would, in the Registrar's opinion, be entitled to apply to court for an order for the administration by the court of the deceased's estate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has provided evidence acceptable to the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 22"
DECLARE `Cessation Facts` HAS
    `the registered person stops carrying on business in Singapore under the registered business name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the person stopped` IS A DATE
    `the date the person lodges the notice of cessation, if it has been lodged` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the Registrar has allowed the person to lodge an advance notice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date specified in the advance notice as the date of stopping, if any` IS A MAYBE DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 23"
DECLARE `Non-trading Facts` HAS
    `the Registrar has reasonable cause to believe that the registered person is not carrying on business in Singapore in respect of the registered business name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar gave the person written notice stating the proposal to cancel and the date by which any objection must be delivered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date of the notice` IS A DATE
    `the date specified in the notice for delivering any objection` IS A DATE
    `the person has answered that the person is not carrying on business under the registered business name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the Registrar received a written objection, if any` IS A MAYBE DATE

DECLARE `How the Registration Ended` IS ONE OF
    `cancelled under section 12(2)`
    `cancelled under section 14`
    `cancelled under section 23`
    `ceased under section 22`
    `ended in another way`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 24"
DECLARE `Restoration Facts` HAS
    `how the registration ended` IS A `How the Registration Ended`
    `the date the registration was cancelled or ceased` IS A DATE
    `the date the application to restore is lodged` IS A DATE
    `the Registrar allows a longer time in special circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a restriction against registration under section 9 applies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the outstanding renewal fees have been paid` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the prescribed late renewal penalty has been paid` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Part 2 -- Registration: the nouns of sections 25 to 31`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 25"
DECLARE `Court Rectification Facts` HAS
    `evidence has been adduced before the General Division of the High Court by an applicant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a particular recorded in the register appears erroneous or defective as a result of that evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the order requires a fresh document showing the rectification to be filed` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 26"
DECLARE `Rectification Notice Facts` HAS
    `the notice is lodged by a registered person or the person's authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice is of an error in a document relating to the person's particulars filed or lodged with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the error is typographical or clerical in nature` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice is of an error in the filing or lodgment of a document relating to the person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the error is, in the Registrar's opinion, unintended and does not prejudice any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `rectifying the register would expunge a document from the register` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 27"
DECLARE `Registrar Initiative Facts` HAS
    `the Registrar is satisfied there is a defect or error arising from a grammatical, typographical or similar mistake` IS A BOOLEAN
    `there is evidence of a conflict between the person's particulars and other information in the register or information from a prescribed body` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the circumstances are ones in which written notice is not required` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar gave written notice of the intention to rectify or update` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of days the notice allowed for a written objection` IS A NUMBER
    `a written objection was delivered by the date specified` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar is satisfied that the objection is frivolous or vexatious or has been withdrawn` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 28"
DECLARE `Copy Facts` HAS
    `the person has paid the fees prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the document forms part of the register and has been destroyed under section 38` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the document is prescribed as an excluded document` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the document was submitted on the electronic transaction system on or after the commencement of section 24 of the ACRA (Registry and Regulatory Enhancements) Act 2024` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the entry is a means of notification provided for section 28A(1)(b) of the Accounting and Corporate Regulatory Authority Act 2004, an individual's date of birth, or other prescribed information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the entry is an individual's residential address` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the copy or extract is certified by the Registrar to be a true copy or extract` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 29(2) and (3)"
DECLARE `Earlier Time Facts` HAS
    `the Registrar is satisfied that a transaction should be treated as having been carried out at an earlier date and time` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar has kept a record of the alteration` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 30"
DECLARE `Contact Address Transition Facts` HAS
    `the individual maintained an alternate address with the Registrar immediately before the commencement date` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the alternate address` IS A STRING
    `the individual's residential address` IS A STRING
    `notice of a change of the contact address has been lodged under an ACRA administered Act on or after the commencement date` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contact address lodged` IS A STRING

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 31"
DECLARE `Disability Facts` HAS
    `the person is required to be registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract was made when the person carried on business under the name without being registered under it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract was made when the registration under the name had been cancelled and not restored` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract was made when the registration under the name had ceased and not restored` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract was made when the person was in breach of section 19(1) or 20(1) or (3)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the registration was later restored under section 24` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has applied to the court for relief` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the court is satisfied that the default was accidental or due to inadvertence or some other sufficient reason` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the court is satisfied that on other grounds it is just and equitable to grant relief` IS A BOOLEAN
    `another party has commenced an action to enforce that party's rights under the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person seeks to enforce a right against that party, by counterclaim, set-off or otherwise, in respect of the contract` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Part 3 -- Miscellaneous: the nouns of sections 32 to 45`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 32"
DECLARE `Inspection Facts` HAS
    `the Registrar has authorised the person in writing to be an inspector` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person authorised is an employee of the Authority or a public officer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar or inspector has reason to believe a person is carrying on business at the premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar or inspector declared his or her office` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar or inspector produced his or her written authority to the person affected` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person fails to comply with a request made by, or resists or obstructs, the Registrar or an inspector in the performance of his or her duties` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 33"
DECLARE `Information Request Facts` HAS
    `the person is a person carrying on business, an employee of that person, a person apparently employed at that person's place of business, or a person apparently managing that person's business` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar required the person to answer a question in writing, or summoned the person to appear to answer orally` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has a lawful excuse for not complying` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person complied` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 34"
DECLARE `Bankrupt Facts` HAS
    `the person is an undischarged bankrupt, adjudicated by a Singapore court or a foreign court having jurisdiction in bankruptcy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is required to be registered and carries on business in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person directly or indirectly takes part in or is concerned in the management of a business carried on by a person required to be registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the General Division of the High Court has given permission` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Official Assignee has given written permission` IS A BOOLEAN
    `notice of intention to apply to the General Division of the High Court was served on the Official Assignee and the Official Assignee was heard` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Offence Provision` IS ONE OF
    `failing to appoint an authorised representative or to lodge a notice (section 11(12))`
    `failing to notify cessation of business (section 22(3))`
    `failing to comply with a request of, or obstructing, the Registrar or an inspector (section 32(4))`
    `an undischarged bankrupt carrying on or managing business (section 34(1))`
    `carrying on business unregistered, failing to comply with a summons, or a false statement (section 35(1))`
    `failing to comply with section 19(1) or 20(1) or (3) (section 35(3))`
    `contravening regulations that so provide (section 43(3))`
    `failing to appoint an authorised representative after commencement (section 45(5)(b))`

DECLARE `Penalty` HAS
    `the maximum fine` IS A NUMBER
    `the maximum term of imprisonment in months, if imprisonment is available` IS A MAYBE NUMBER

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 35(1) and (2)"
DECLARE `Offence Facts` HAS
    `the person is required to be registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person carries on business in Singapore without being registered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person carries on business in Singapore under a business name different from the registered business name` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person carries on business under a business name after the registration in respect of it has been cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person carries on business under a business name after the registration in respect of it has ceased` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person, without lawful excuse, fails to comply with a summons or requisition of the Registrar under section 33` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person makes a statement or provides information to the Registrar that is false in a material particular or by omission of a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person knows or has reason to believe it is false` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is not required to be registered in respect of the business name under section 4` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 36"
DECLARE `Display Facts` HAS
    `proof is given that a business name has been displayed in premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidence is given from which the court may infer that the business name refers to a business carried on at the premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `there is proof to the contrary` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 37"
DECLARE `Composition Facts` HAS
    `the offence is prescribed as a compoundable offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the maximum fine prescribed for the offence` IS A NUMBER
    `the sum proposed to be collected` IS A NUMBER
    `the sum has been paid` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 38"
DECLARE `Old Record Facts` HAS
    `the document was filed, lodged, submitted or issued under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the document has been microfilmed or converted to electronic form` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar is of the opinion that it is no longer necessary or desirable to retain the document` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the National Library Board has authorised the destruction under section 17 of the National Library Board Act 1995` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Kind of Court` IS ONE OF
    `a District Court`
    `a Magistrate's Court`
    `any other court`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 39(1)"
DECLARE `Enforcement Facts` HAS
    `the person failed to comply with a provision of this Act, or a provision of another written law requiring a return, account, notice or other document to be filed with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Registrar served notice to comply` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date of service of the Registrar's notice to comply` IS A DATE
    `the person has made good the non-compliance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the person made good the non-compliance, if it has been made good` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the Registrar requested the person to amend, complete and resubmit a document or to submit a fresh document` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date of service of that request` IS A DATE
    `the date the person complied with that request, if the person has` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the Registrar made a request under section 27(7) to take steps within a time to rectify an error or defect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person failed to take those steps within the time specified` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date on which the court considers the Registrar's application` IS A DATE
    `the court` IS A `Kind of Court`
    `the application is made by the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Kind of Business Holder` IS ONE OF
    `an individual proprietor`
    `a firm`
    `a corporation`
    `a person who carries on business wholly or mainly as nominee of or trustee for another person`

DECLARE `Kind of Body` IS ONE OF
    `a body corporate, including a limited liability partnership`
    `a firm`
    `an unincorporated association other than a firm`

DECLARE `Role in Body` IS ONE OF
    `an officer of the body corporate`
    `a member of a body corporate whose affairs are managed by its members, acting in connection with the member's functions of management`
    `a partner of the firm, including a person purporting to act as a partner`
    `an officer of the unincorporated association or a member of its governing body`
    `none of those`

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 40"
DECLARE `Body Offence Facts` HAS
    `kind of body` IS A `Kind of Body`
    `an offence under this Act committed by the body is proved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person's role` IS A `Role in Body`
    `the offence was committed with the person's consent or connivance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence is attributable to neglect on the person's part` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 41"
DECLARE `Liability Facts` HAS
    `the person is the Authority, the Registrar or another officer or employee of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
    `there is an error or inaccuracy in the register, or in a certificate, certified extract, copy or other document made or issued under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the error or inaccuracy was due to a lack of reasonable care and good faith on the part of the Registrar or another officer or employee of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Kind of Recipient` IS ONE OF
    `an individual`
    `a firm`
    `a corporation or an unincorporated association`

DECLARE `Service Route` IS ONE OF
    `delivering it to the individual personally`
    `leaving it with an adult apparently resident at the usual or last known address of the individual's residence`
    `sending it by ordinary or prepaid registered post to the usual or last known address of the individual's residence`
    `leaving it with an adult apparently resident or employed at, or posting it to, the individual's contact address`
    `leaving it with an adult apparently employed at, or posting it to, the usual or last known address of the individual's place of business`
    `affixing a copy in a conspicuous place at the individual's contact address or usual or last known address of residence or business`
    `delivering it to any one of the partners or the secretary or other like officer of the firm`
    `leaving it at, or posting it to, the principal or last known place of business of the firm in Singapore`
    `delivering it to the secretary or other like officer of the corporation or unincorporated association, or the manager of a limited liability partnership`
    `leaving it at, or posting it to, the registered office or principal office of the corporation or unincorporated association in Singapore`
    `sending it by fax to the fax number given to the Registrar`
    `sending it by email to the last email address given to the Registrar`

DECLARE `Service Method` IS ONE OF
    `personal delivery` HAS
        `the date it is delivered` IS A DATE
    `ordinary post` HAS
        `the date it would in the ordinary course of post be delivered` IS A DATE
        `it is returned undelivered` IS A BOOLEAN
    `prepaid registered post` HAS
        `the date it is posted` IS A DATE
    `fax` HAS
        `the date of transmission` IS A DATE
        `a notification of successful transmission is received on the sending fax machine` IS A BOOLEAN
    `email` HAS
        `the date the email becomes capable of being retrieved` IS A DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 42(4) and (5)"
DECLARE `Summons Facts` HAS
    `the summons is delivered to the person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the summons is delivered to an adult residing at the person's last known place of residence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the summons is sent by prepaid registered post in a cover addressed to the person at the person's last known place of residence or business or an address the person provided` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the cover was properly addressed, stamped and posted by prepaid registered post` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 45(2), (8), (9)"
DECLARE `Transitional Registration Facts` HAS
    `the person was registered or deemed registered under the repealed Act immediately before 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the registration would have expired if this Act had not been enacted` IS A DATE
    `an application for registration under the repealed Act was pending immediately before 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a reservation of name under section 13(3) of the repealed Act had not expired before 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the reservation would have expired if the repealed Act were still in force` IS A DATE

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 45(4)"
DECLARE `Local Manager Facts` HAS
    `the person (A) was registered as a local manager appointed by a person carrying on business (B) under regulations made under the repealed Act before 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN
    `A or B lodged a notice within 30 days after 3 January 2016 that A has not been appointed as B's authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN
    `A or B lodged a notice within 30 days after 3 January 2016 that A does not meet the criteria in section 11(2)` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Business Names Registration Act 2014, s 45(5)"
DECLARE `Transitional Residence Facts` HAS
    `the registrant is treated as registered under section 45(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the individual proprietor, all the partners of the firm or all the officers of the foreign company reside outside Singapore on 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN
    `section 45(4) applies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at least one authorised representative was appointed within 30 days after 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Regulative duties: the parties and acts`

DECLARE `Party under the Act` IS ONE OF
    `The registrant`
    `The former authorised representative`
    `The continuing partners`

DECLARE `Act under the Act` IS ONE OF
    `appoint an authorised representative`
    `appoint a new authorised representative`
    `lodge a notice of the appointment of, and the consent of, the authorised representative`
    `lodge a notice that the authorised representative has ceased to be, or ceased to be qualified to be, the authorised representative`
    `lodge a notice of the new residential address`
    `lodge a notice of the change in particulars`
    `lodge a notice of a partner's cessation`
    `lodge a notice of cessation of business`
    `change the registered business name as the Registrar directed`
